WEBVTT

00:02.377 --> 00:03.628
Captioning Provided By:
MTV Networks
字幕提供者：
MTV网络

00:03.712 --> 00:05.004
Are ya ready, kids?
孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:05.088 --> 00:06.506
I can't  hear  you.
我听不到你说话。

00:06.589 --> 00:08.425
Kids:
Aye, aye, Captain.
孩子们：
是的，是的，船长。

00:08.508 --> 00:11.469
♪ Ohh... ♪
♪ 哦...♪

00:11.553 --> 00:13.596
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:13.680 --> 00:15.682
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:15.765 --> 00:17.517
Captain: ♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he ♪
队长：♪ 吸水性的，黄色的
他是多孔的 ♪

00:17.600 --> 00:19.102
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:19.394 --> 00:21.688
Captain: ♪ If nautical nonsense
be somethin' you wish ♪
船长：♪ 如果是航海方面的废话
成为你所希望的那样 ♪

00:21.771 --> 00:23.148
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:23.440 --> 00:25.525
Captain: ♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish ♪
船长：♪ 然后降落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:25.608 --> 00:26.609
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:26.693 --> 00:27.652
Captain: ♪ Ready? ♪
队长：♪ 准备好了吗？ ♪

00:27.944 --> 00:29.529
All: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
全部： ♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:29.612 --> 00:31.573
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:31.656 --> 00:33.616
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:33.700 --> 00:37.120
Captain: ♪ SpongeBob
SquarePants ♪
队长：♪ 海绵宝宝
方裤♪

01:02.479 --> 01:03.563
: Ahh...
: 啊...

01:03.772 --> 01:05.857
Nothing quite like
a relaxing stroll
没有什么很像
轻松漫步

01:05.940 --> 01:08.568
deep  in Jellyfish Fields.
水母田深处。

01:13.364 --> 01:15.200
I'd know that sound anywhere.
我在任何地方都知道这个声音。

01:15.283 --> 01:18.745
It's a terrifying shriek.
这是令人恐惧的尖叫声。

01:18.828 --> 01:20.580
But where's it coming from?
但它从哪里来？

01:24.542 --> 01:27.378
Patrick, what is with
all this shrieking?
帕特里克，怎么了
所有这些尖叫声？

01:27.462 --> 01:28.922
You know I walk
here on Tuesdays?
你知道我走路
周二在这里吗？

01:29.005 --> 01:30.882
Sorry, SpongeBob,
that wasn't me.
对不起，海绵宝宝，
那不是我。

01:30.965 --> 01:33.593
Patrick, I know I heard
a terrifying shriek.
帕特里克，我知道我听到了
一声可怕的尖叫声。

01:33.676 --> 01:35.261
So did I, SpongeBob
我也是，海绵宝宝

01:35.345 --> 01:37.055
but I was
just mimicking it.
但我当时
just mimicking it.

01:37.138 --> 01:39.474
So you were
mimicking it.
所以你是
模仿它。

01:39.557 --> 01:41.935
Patrick, please don't
do that, it is really...
帕特里克，请不要
这样做，真的是……

01:42.018 --> 01:43.144
Wait a minute.
等一下。

01:43.478 --> 01:44.521
If the shriek wasn't
coming from you
如果尖叫声不是
来自你

01:44.604 --> 01:45.814
then were was it...
那么是不是...

01:47.148 --> 01:49.859
It's over there behind
that kelp shrub.
就在后面那儿
那个海带灌木。

01:52.695 --> 01:55.031
The terrifying shriek must
have come from this clam.
恐怖的尖叫声一定是
来自这个蛤。

01:59.619 --> 02:01.496
Hey, Patrick, I think there's
something wrong with...
嘿，帕特里克，我想有
有什么问题...

02:07.710 --> 02:09.128
Oh, what are
we gonna do?
哦，什么是
我们要做什么？

02:09.337 --> 02:12.131
Well, the last time
I remembered coughing like that
嗯，最后一次
我记得我是这样咳嗽的

02:12.215 --> 02:15.510
I was sitting at home eating
a box of kelp jerky.
我坐在家里吃饭
一盒海带干

02:15.593 --> 02:18.096
Oh, and you were coughing
because you got some
stuck in your throat?
哦，你还在咳嗽
因为你有一些
卡在喉咙里了？

02:18.179 --> 02:20.682
I got the TV remote
stuck in my throat.
我拿到了电视遥控器
卡在我的喉咙里。

02:20.765 --> 02:22.642
Patrick,
this clam is choking.
帕特里克，
这蛤蜊窒息了。

02:22.725 --> 02:24.394
Luckily, I come prepared.
幸运的是，我是有准备的。

02:24.477 --> 02:26.938
There, there, clammy.
那里，那里，湿漉漉的。

02:27.021 --> 02:28.189
SpongeBob,
what are you doing?
海绵宝宝，
你在做什么？

02:28.273 --> 02:29.649
They like this.
他们喜欢这样。

02:29.732 --> 02:31.317
You always give
a choking victim
你总是给予
窒息的受害者

02:31.401 --> 02:33.570
the "slimelich"
maneuver first.
“史莱姆利奇”
首先进行机动。

02:33.653 --> 02:35.071
And if that doesn't work
如果这不起作用

02:35.280 --> 02:38.116
you walk away and pretend
like you never saw them before.
你走开并假装
就像你以前从未见过他们一样。

02:38.199 --> 02:39.617
Like this.
像这样。

02:39.701 --> 02:40.535
Ready clam?
准备好蛤蜊了吗？

02:42.412 --> 02:43.788
Patrick: Ohh!
帕特里克：哦！

02:43.872 --> 02:46.124
Well, SpongeBob, I think
I might go catch a movie.
好吧，海绵宝宝，我想
我可能会去看电影。

02:46.207 --> 02:47.750
Hey, what about the clam?
嘿，蛤蜊呢？

02:47.834 --> 02:49.878
What clam? I've never seen
that clam before in my life.
什么蛤？我从未见过
我生命中以前的那个蛤蜊。

02:49.961 --> 02:51.546
But...
但...

02:52.630 --> 02:54.465
Patrick.
帕特里克.

02:54.549 --> 02:56.092
The clam had a baby.
蛤蜊生下了孩子。

02:56.175 --> 02:57.886
That's not a baby,
SpongeBob.
那不是一个婴儿，
海绵宝宝。

02:57.969 --> 02:59.512
Well then,
what could it be?
那么，
可能是什么？

02:59.596 --> 03:01.097
I'll give you a hint.
我给你一个提示。

03:01.180 --> 03:04.684
What's white and round
and comes out of clams?
什么东西又白又圆
是从蛤蜊里出来的？

03:04.767 --> 03:06.144
Their... Eyes?
他们的……眼睛？

03:06.227 --> 03:09.147
No, silly, a volleyball.
不，傻瓜，排球。

03:09.230 --> 03:10.732
A baby volleyball.
婴儿排球。

03:15.445 --> 03:16.571
I got it!
我得到了它！

03:16.654 --> 03:17.822
: Oh.
： 哦。

03:17.906 --> 03:19.198
Good idea,
coming here, Patrick.
好主意，
来这里，帕特里克。

03:19.282 --> 03:21.200
That's my specialty.
这是我的专长。

03:21.284 --> 03:22.619
Having good ideas?
有好主意吗？

03:22.702 --> 03:23.995
Being called Patrick.
被称为帕特里克。

03:24.078 --> 03:26.289
Maybe we should do
some stretches first.
也许我们应该做
首先进行一些伸展运动。

03:26.372 --> 03:27.290
Good idea.
好主意。

03:27.540 --> 03:28.750
Well, that's
my specialty.
嗯，那就是
我的专长。

03:28.833 --> 03:29.876
Having good ideas?
有好主意吗？

03:29.959 --> 03:32.128
Nope, doing some
stretches first.
不，做一些
首先伸展。

03:36.841 --> 03:39.636
Yeah, no, I don't know.
是的，不，我不知道。

03:39.719 --> 03:41.262
The thing's 100 years old, how
should I know?
这东西已经有100年历史了，怎么办？
我应该知道吗？

03:41.346 --> 03:43.556
Yeah, all right, look,
if you don't want it...
是的，好吧，看，
如果你不想要它...

03:43.640 --> 03:45.767
Uh-huh, yeah.
嗯嗯，是的。

03:45.850 --> 03:48.978
...Well, I...
……嗯，我……

03:50.563 --> 03:53.274
Uh, yeah, I'm...
I'm still here.
呃，是的，我是...
我还在这里。

03:53.358 --> 03:55.318
SpongeBob: 138, 139...
海绵宝宝：138、139...

03:55.401 --> 03:56.569
Gentlemen.
先生们。

03:56.653 --> 03:57.487
Hello.
你好。

03:57.570 --> 03:58.655
I couldn't help noticing
我忍不住注意到

03:58.738 --> 04:01.074
what a lovely ball that is.
那是一个多么可爱的球啊。

04:01.157 --> 04:02.450
Oh, really?
哦真的吗？

04:02.533 --> 04:04.118
Yes.
是的。

04:04.202 --> 04:06.412
I'd sure like to
get a closer look.
我当然愿意
仔细看看。

04:06.496 --> 04:08.039
Oh, we don't mind,
do we, Patrick?
哦，我们不介意，
我们是吗，帕特里克？

04:08.122 --> 04:09.874
Well, just don't
take too long.
好吧，只是不要
花太长时间。

04:09.958 --> 04:12.335
We were just about
to start playing with it.
我们刚刚
开始玩它。

04:12.418 --> 04:13.711
Oh...
哦...

04:13.795 --> 04:16.047
It, uh, won't take
long at all... Ooh.
它，呃，不会需要
一点都长……哦。

04:16.130 --> 04:17.507
It's heavier
than I imagined
比较重
比我想象的

04:17.590 --> 04:19.258
and, uh, shinier too.
而且，呃，也更闪亮。

04:19.342 --> 04:20.343
Where'd you find it?
你在哪里找到的？

04:20.593 --> 04:23.096
We found it  deep
in Jellyfish Fields.
我们发现它很深
在水母田里。

04:23.179 --> 04:24.097
Really?
真的吗？

04:24.180 --> 04:25.098
What was it
doing there?
那是什么
在那里做什么？

04:25.181 --> 04:26.099
Choking a clam.
噎死一只蛤蜊。

04:26.182 --> 04:27.600
Well, um...
嗯，嗯...

04:27.684 --> 04:29.894
what would you say
if I were to offer you
你会说什么
如果我要给你

04:29.978 --> 04:33.231
a small fortune in exchange
for your shiny ball?
一笔小钱作为交换
为了你闪亮的球？

04:33.314 --> 04:36.442
What do you mean,
small fortune?
你是什么意思，
小财？

04:49.414 --> 04:53.001
Whoa, how many more trucks do
you think there'll be, Patrick?
哇，还有多少卡车
你认为会有吗，帕特里克？

04:53.084 --> 04:54.377
Huh?
啊？

04:54.460 --> 04:55.545
Oh, I don't know.
哦，我不知道。

04:55.712 --> 04:57.255
I am getting
kind of hungry, though.
我正在得到
不过有点饿了。

04:57.338 --> 04:59.257
I'll catch up with
you later, SpongeBob.
我会赶上
稍后你，海绵宝宝。

05:00.425 --> 05:02.218
Well, that looks
like the last of 'em.
嗯，看起来
就像他们中的最后一个一样。

05:02.301 --> 05:03.845
The last
of what?
最后一个
什么？

05:03.928 --> 05:06.097
So did you figure out
what you're gonna do
那么你有没有发现
你要做什么

05:06.180 --> 05:08.349
with this fat
stack of cabbage yet?
有了这个脂肪
一堆白菜了吗？

05:08.433 --> 05:10.101
Yup, I mean, nope.
是的，我的意思是，不。

05:10.184 --> 05:12.103
Well, my dad always told me:
嗯，我爸爸总是告诉我：

05:12.186 --> 05:14.814
"When you have money, you need
to do more than just spend it.
“当你有钱的时候，你需要
不仅仅是花钱。

05:14.897 --> 05:16.357
You need to have a plan."
你需要有一个计划。”

05:16.441 --> 05:17.817
Wow, your dad
really told you that?
哇，你爸爸
真的告诉过你了吗？

05:17.900 --> 05:19.360
Well, what he said was
嗯，他说的是

05:19.610 --> 05:21.988
"How many times do I have to
tell you not to stand there?"
“我要经历多少次
叫你不要站在那里？”

05:22.071 --> 05:23.281
But I knew what he meant.
但我知道他的意思。

05:23.364 --> 05:25.450
Hey, Patrick, I know
a good place to go
嘿，帕特里克，我知道
一个好去处

05:25.533 --> 05:27.535
when you don't know
what to buy.
当你不知道的时候
买什么。

05:27.618 --> 05:29.454
The mall.
商场。

05:29.537 --> 05:31.372
Whoo!
呼！

05:34.083 --> 05:35.209
Touchdown!
接地！

05:36.753 --> 05:38.796
Aww...
哇...

05:39.756 --> 05:41.215
Patrick, where'd you go?
帕特里克，你去哪儿了？

05:44.218 --> 05:45.511
Oh, there you are.
哦，你来了。

06:06.866 --> 06:09.952
Patrick, that was
the best shopping day ever.
帕特里克，那是
有史以来最好的购物日。

06:10.036 --> 06:11.746
You can say
that again.
你可以说
再说一遍。

06:11.829 --> 06:13.414
Best shopping day ever.
有史以来最好的购物日。

06:13.498 --> 06:14.832
Patrick, I've got an idea.
帕特里克，我有一个主意。

06:14.916 --> 06:15.875
Really?
真的吗？

06:15.958 --> 06:17.043
Let's go
shopping again
我们走吧
再次购物

06:17.126 --> 06:19.962
and this time...
buy stuff.
而这一次...
买东西。

06:21.214 --> 06:23.466
Oh, wasn't that
incredible, Patrick?
哦，那不是吗
难以置信，帕特里克？

06:23.549 --> 06:24.884
I mean,
with all this money
我的意思是，
用这么多钱

06:24.967 --> 06:27.011
we could've bought
anything in the whole world.
我们本来可以买
全世界的任何事物。

06:27.095 --> 06:28.012
Yup.
是的。

06:28.096 --> 06:29.263
So tell me,
what'd you buy?
所以告诉我，
你买了什么？

06:29.347 --> 06:32.683
A lifetime supply
of strawberry gum.
终身供应
草莓口香糖。

06:32.767 --> 06:34.060
:
Hey, me too.
：
嘿，我也是。

06:34.310 --> 06:36.771
And to think we barely even
put a dent in my fortune.
想想我们甚至几乎
使我的财富受到损害。

06:36.854 --> 06:38.564
French Man:
The following Thursday...
法国人：
接下来的星期四...

06:38.648 --> 06:40.358
Two please.
请两个。

06:40.441 --> 06:43.027
One for me and one for
my best friend, Patrick.
一份给我，一份给
我最好的朋友帕特里克。

06:43.111 --> 06:44.821
I didn't really ask
who they're for?
我真的没有问
他们是为了谁？

06:44.904 --> 06:46.781
Thanks.
谢谢。

06:46.864 --> 06:48.074
There you go.
就这样吧。

06:48.157 --> 06:50.284
It was only 59 cents
for the ice cream.
仅需 59 美分
为了冰淇淋。

06:50.368 --> 06:51.911
Oh, that's OK.
哦，没关系。

06:51.994 --> 06:53.079
I kind of have
more money
我有点有
更多的钱

06:53.329 --> 06:54.956
than I know what
to do with right now.
我不知道是什么
现在就做。

06:55.039 --> 06:56.916
Looks like my ex-wife was wrong.
看来我的前妻错了。

06:56.999 --> 06:58.835
I  am  in the right
line of work.
我是对的
工作线。

06:58.918 --> 07:01.420
Uh, triple "goo-berry"
sundae, please?
呃，三个“goo-berry”
圣代，请吗？

07:01.504 --> 07:02.922
Extra nuts.
额外的坚果。

07:03.005 --> 07:04.340
That's gonna be $2.98.
那将是 2.98 美元。

07:04.590 --> 07:07.552
Uh, hey, Bert, you got like,
eight cents I can borrow?
呃，嘿，伯特，你就像，
八分钱我可以借吗？

07:07.635 --> 07:08.678
Yeah, let me check.
是的，让我检查一下。

07:08.761 --> 07:10.096
No, I don't, Bill, sorry.
不，我不知道，比尔，抱歉。

07:10.179 --> 07:12.223
You know, why is it
I always have money
你知道，为什么会这样
我总是有钱

07:12.306 --> 07:13.766
when  you  need to borrow it?
什么时候需要借？

07:13.850 --> 07:15.685
Well, I don't know
what to say, I...
嗯，我不知道
怎么说呢，我...

07:15.768 --> 07:17.603
Are you gentlemen
low on funds?
你们是先生们吗
资金不足？

07:17.687 --> 07:19.188
Let me help.
让我帮忙。

07:19.272 --> 07:20.064
Here you go.
干得好。

07:20.148 --> 07:21.440
Whoa, uh, that's OK.
哇哦，没关系。

07:21.524 --> 07:22.817
I just need eight cents.
我只需要八美分。

07:22.900 --> 07:24.777
That's OK, I already
got my ice cream, see?
没关系，我已经
我的冰淇淋拿到了，看到了吗？

07:24.861 --> 07:27.613
OK, um... Thanks.
好的，嗯...谢谢。

07:27.697 --> 07:28.906
Sure thing.
当然可以。

07:29.115 --> 07:30.199
Do you need
some too, Bert?
你需要吗
还有一些，伯特？

07:30.283 --> 07:31.909
Excuse me,
can I have some too?
对不起，
我也可以吃一些吗？

07:31.993 --> 07:33.494
Oh, you wanna buy
some ice cream?
哦，你想买吗
一些冰淇淋？

07:33.578 --> 07:34.787
No, I'm allergic
不，我过敏

07:34.871 --> 07:37.290
but... I'll be
your best friend.
但是...我会的
你最好的朋友。

07:37.373 --> 07:38.541
It's a deal.
这是一笔交易。

07:38.833 --> 07:40.585
Hey, I think I could hang out
with this guy for awhile.
嘿，我想我可以出去玩
和这个家伙相处了一段时间。

07:40.668 --> 07:41.711
Me too.
我也是。

07:41.794 --> 07:42.628
Me too.
我也是。

07:42.712 --> 07:44.172
Me three.
我三个。

07:46.257 --> 07:47.300
Ice cream?
冰淇淋？

07:53.014 --> 07:55.516
: Yes?
： 是的？

07:56.642 --> 07:59.979
Uh, I'm here
to see SpongeBob.
呃，我在这儿
去看海绵宝宝。

08:00.062 --> 08:01.689
And are you on
the guest list, sir?
你在吗
客人名单，先生？

08:01.772 --> 08:03.733
Well... I don't think so.
嗯...我不这么认为。

08:03.816 --> 08:05.026
Normally, I...
正常情况下，我...

08:05.234 --> 08:06.736
Well, then I'm afraid
I can't let you in, sir.
好吧，那我恐怕
我不能让你进来，先生。

08:06.819 --> 08:07.820
Good day, sir.
美好的一天，先生。

08:07.904 --> 08:09.822
Good day.
再会。

08:09.906 --> 08:13.075
Uh, your shoe's untied.
呃，你的鞋带解开了。

08:13.910 --> 08:15.328
Oh, why so it is.
哦，为什么会这样呢。

08:19.040 --> 08:20.499
Thank you, sir.
谢谢您，先生。

08:22.585 --> 08:25.504
And so he was like,
"Do you wanna buy
some ice cream?"
所以他就像，
“你想买吗
来点冰淇淋吗？”

08:25.588 --> 08:28.007
: Ice cream,
